%% Read path decision tree (Bloom → Index/Summary → Data)
%% Alt: Decision tree for point and slice reads across Bloom, Summary/Index, and Data
%% Caption: Negative lookups exit at Bloom; positives navigate via Summary/Index to Data
flowchart TD
  Q[Read request: key or slice] --> B{Bloom contains?}
  B -- No --> R0[Return not found]
  B -- Yes --> S{Have Summary/Index?}
  S -- No --> SEQ[Sequential scan Data.db]
  S -- Yes --> SUM[Binary search Summary.db]
  SUM --> IDX[Index seek in Index.db]
  IDX --> D[Data read in Data.db]
  Q -->|Slice| TR[Token range iteration]
  TR --> SUM
  classDef note fill:#eef,stroke:#88a,stroke-width:1px
  class R0,SEQ,D note

